WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.502
-Molly, thanks so much for
coming, being here in person!

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:06.939
-Oh, my God. I love it.
-I love that you're here.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.841
I talk to you
whenever I get a chance,

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.977
and I don't want to bother you
on social media because --

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:15.615
I follow you on Instagram.
Good follow, by the way.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.283
-Whoo!
-And you really are fun.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.921
Yesterday you had a catwalk-off,
of which outfit you should wear.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.756
And it just made me laugh.
I loved it.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.092
It was like -- It was --

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:29.061
You called yourself --
"Good Sandy or Bad Sandy."

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.431
-Oh, yeah.
-And I was like, "Yeah."

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.165
I would go for Bad Sandy.
I like Bad Sandy.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.367
-Mmm. Good. I like that.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.002
-Yeah, because there's
a little mysterious to --

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.704
-Leather jacket
or no leather jacket?

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.872
-Yeah, yeah. It was good.
-Aw. Thanks, Jimmy.

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:43.476
-But I don't want to like
too much and comment too much

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:45.477
because I'd be like,
"I'm not stalking you."

00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:48.114
I just enjoy you, and I just go
like, "Oh, I love that."

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.516
'Cause it's so funny
and interesting.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:52.585
You posted something
the other day.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.187
-Oh, yeah.
-This is from --

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.889
@theofficialsuperstar
is the Instagram.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.224
-Ooh.
-And this is it right here.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.361
This is Sally O'Malley
with Betty O'Malley.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:03.563
-Yeah!
-I mean, come on.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:06.732
-[ Laughter ]
-With Betty O'Malley.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.234
-Wait. Explain Betty O'Malley.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.269
-Betty O'Malley.
Well, what happened was --

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:14.674
I had to do -- For my
daughter's school fundraiser,

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.109
they asked me
to do Sally O'Malley.

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.745
And I was like, "Yeah, but I
don't really have the costume."

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:22.682
It's in -- You know, it's in,
like, some storage place

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.650
or in the -- But anyhow,

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.020
I was able to get the costume
from Dale Richards.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.855
-No way.
From "Saturday Night Live."

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.389
-I did. So he sent it to me.

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:32.692
And then I had it for
like 24 hours in my house

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:36.729
before I went to do this remote,
you know, show for my school.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.564
So I put the costume on
and I told my husband --

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:40.099
I was like,
"We should take pictures."

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:41.800
And I wanted to take pictures
with the kids.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.602
Because when I did
the character, it was before

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:46.172
I was married or had children,
so I just did, like,

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.241
a photo shoot around my house
as the character.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.275
-How are the kids?
-Stella and Nolan.

00:01:50.275 --> 00:01:51.611
And, yeah, they're great.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.613
We just took the kids to Hawaii
with all --

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.550
They got to bring their friends,
and it was so much fun.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.120
-But the dog --
Does the dog have wigs or --

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.588
That was my --
-Yeah.

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.857
-That's not natural, right?
That's not natural hair?

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:07.059
-That's not natural.
Yeah, she does have little --

00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:08.661
I like putting little wigs
on her.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.496
Like, I went to a pet store.

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:12.531
I like the close-up shot.

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:13.967
Yes!

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.435
That's...

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:16.836
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:18.537
She's so cute.

00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:21.540
-I love it!
-Yeah, isn't it sweet?

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.676
-Look at how cute --
-When did you get Betty?

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.511
-Betty. We got her --
She's a little rescue dog,

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:27.079
and we have another dog
named Cinnamon.

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:30.816
And, ohh. They add so much joy
to the house.

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:33.052
Isn't she cute?

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.587
-There was also a video
that you posted.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.889
If you ever --
If you're in a bad mood,

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:39.659
just go to this Instagram --
@theofficialsuperstar.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.094
Here's Betty going for a swim.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.630
-Oh, my gosh.
I got to see this.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:46.932
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:49.502
Cinnamon with her curlers.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.839
And that's Cinnamon. Ohh! Yes!

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.041
-Good swimmer.
-Yes, she's a good swimmer.

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.877
They're stars!
-Yeah, she is a star.

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:00.112
I heard that Nick Jonas got you
on Instagram. Is that true?

00:03:00.112 --> 00:03:01.747
-Oh, yeah. Nick Jonas.
That was so funny.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:04.717
I was in Park City, Utah,
with my manager, Steven Levy,

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:08.821
and we met Nick Jonas
and his dear friend Dave O.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:12.324
And it was, like, a bar
in Park City, Utah.

00:03:12.324 --> 00:03:14.827
And they got me
to join Instagram at the bar.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.662
-What?
They just took a picture and --

00:03:16.662 --> 00:03:19.231
-Well, we just started talking,
and Nick Jonas was so nice.

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:22.034
And Nick Jonas and I
share the same birthday.

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:24.470
And Dave O was like,
"You got to be on Instagram!"

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.205
So just at the bar
he was like --

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:28.374
You know, I think he thought
of @theofficialsuperstar.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.009
And Nick Jonas was like,
"Yeah, do it.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.644
I'll be the first one
to like your..."

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.245
So, that was Nick Jonas
and Dave O.

00:03:33.245 --> 00:03:34.681
Isn't that wild?
-Wow.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.049
-And then this was so funny.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:40.386
Nick Jonas DM'd me --
This was like a year ago

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.021
or whatever.
He DM'd me and he's like,

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.389
"Oh, I have a question for you."

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.157
And so I told my daughter,
Stella, and I was like,

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:47.893
"Oh, my God.
Nick Jonas, you know, DM'd me."

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:50.429
And I responded back
with, like, a heart and then --

00:03:50.429 --> 00:03:51.764
By accident,
I didn't mean to do that.

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:53.533
And then I was like, "O, my God.
I'm so embarrassed.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:57.136
I put a heart. Like,
I'm acting like a teenage girl!"

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:59.171
She was like, "You can erase it.
You can erase it."

00:03:59.171 --> 00:04:01.841
So I, like, erased it...

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:04.543
I was like, "That's so dorky."
-I know, dude.

00:04:04.543 --> 00:04:07.346
I send Nick Jonas hearts, too.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:08.815
-Yeah. Of course.
It's Nick Jonas.

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:10.749
-You guys, what I want to say
I love about Jimmy

00:04:10.749 --> 00:04:14.720
is Jimmy is the silliest --
has the silliest sense of humor.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.623
And I miss your --
how much you make me laugh.

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:19.058
You're very silly.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.492
-Oh, my God.

00:04:20.492 --> 00:04:21.961
We talk about it every time
on the show.

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:23.595
You know what I was thinking
of doing this time?

00:04:23.595 --> 00:04:25.898
But I'm not ready for it
this time. I'm unprepared.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.900
-What?
-I wanted to have our cry-off.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.503
-Oh, my God. Whoa. Okay.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:33.473
-I wanted to see if we --
Not now. I can't do it now.

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.642
-[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's a really good idea.

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:38.277
-But it's an interesting game,
and I got to be in the zone.

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:40.513
I got to be in the zone.
-You have to be in the zone.

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:42.481
I'll do it. Okay. Great.
-Next time?

00:04:42.481 --> 00:04:44.617
-Next time. I'm scared.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.852
Well, if we did it --
You want to do it now?

00:04:46.852 --> 00:04:49.389
-Now?
-Oh, my God. I am so scared.

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:52.524
-[ Cheers and applause ]
-This is not planned.

00:04:52.524 --> 00:04:54.026
-All right.
-[Bleep]. I'm scared.

00:04:54.026 --> 00:04:55.761
-All right. Can you --
All right. Wait.

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:57.630
I'll look in the camera.
-This is pressure.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.998
-I know.
-So, wait. Okay.

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:00.700
-Can you do it?
-I mean, I'll try.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.068
Where do I look?

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:04.937
-You look in camera one.
-Camera one.

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:07.006
Okay, but give us time.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.741
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:10.609
Music?

00:05:10.609 --> 00:05:14.247
[ Audience awws ]

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:16.315
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:05:16.315 --> 00:05:18.318
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:31.130
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.798
-I was really close.

00:05:32.798 --> 00:05:35.001
♪♪

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:36.903
[ Laughter ]

00:05:44.309 --> 00:05:46.212
-You are unbelievable.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.114
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:50.549
♪♪

00:05:50.549 --> 00:05:52.885
Oh, my gosh. Oh, my gosh!

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:55.888
All right. Stop. No, no. Wait.

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:58.590
Oh, no. You're in -- Oh, no.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.492
-[ Sighs ]

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:02.228
-She's in the zone.

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:04.430
-[ Sobs ]

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.064
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:06.064 --> 00:06:08.501
It's fake. It's fake!

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:09.935
-Dude, that was great, though.

00:06:09.935 --> 00:06:11.403
-I had a moment
where I was like,

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:14.206
"This is so sweet, like,
being with an audience."

00:06:14.206 --> 00:06:16.175
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:18.744 --> 00:06:20.913
-That was nice.

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:23.683
I love you, bud.
-I don't know.

00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:26.885
And, like, Questlove.
And I just --

00:06:26.885 --> 00:06:28.354
I actually am like --

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:30.556
It's so sweet
being back with people.

00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:34.059
And I love you, Jimmy.
Seriously.

00:06:34.059 --> 00:06:36.762
-Me too...

00:06:36.762 --> 00:06:39.198
Actually, if you zoom in,
I'm there.

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:41.167
You did. You got me there.
-Okay, good.

00:06:41.167 --> 00:06:43.202
-If you zoom in, I'm there.

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:45.371
-Yes!
-You got me. You got me good.

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:47.105
-Okay, good. I got you!

00:06:47.105 --> 00:06:49.509
What if we just got really --
What if we just, like,

00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:51.777
turned the whole show around
and we were just really dark?

00:06:51.777 --> 00:06:55.348
And I was like,
"Remember when I called you?"

00:06:55.348 --> 00:06:56.682
And we just cry.

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:59.151
-We have so many fun things
to talk about.

00:06:59.151 --> 00:07:00.519
You have two shows on HBO Max.

00:07:00.519 --> 00:07:02.220
-Okay, yes, yes, yes.
Fun things, yes.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.290
-You have "White Lotus"
I want to talk about.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.991
-Yes!
-And we have "The Other Two."

00:07:05.991 --> 00:07:08.528
I want to talk more with Molly
Shannon when we come back.

